            "Uganda Ordinary/Tourist Visa, Single Entry: A letter stating reason for transit and country of destination (Transit) Return Ticket (Tourism) Cover letter detailing the purpose of visit (Other) Support Document for the purpose of visit (Medical) (Medical) Return Ticket (Family_visit) Immigration Status of the Host (Family_visit) Invitation Letter (Family_visit) Invitation letter for the Conference (Conference) Passport bio-data page (with validity of at least 6 months)) (All) Recent Passport-size Photograph (All) Application Fee USD 50",
